<title>USA: CTC chairman Oscar Garreton resigns.</title>
<headline>CTC chairman Oscar Garreton resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compania de Telecomunicaciones de Chile S.A. said Thursday its board had accepted the resignation of Oscar Garreton as chairman.</p>
<p>In a statement released from Santiago, the company said Garreton had stepped down to devote himself to various personal projects.</p>
<p>The company said the board had elected Claudio E. Garcia as chairman. Garcia had been the company's chief financial officer since 1989, it said.</p>
<p>Garcia is also a director of several companies affiliated with CTC, it added.</p>
</text>
